1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:01,920
I didn't kill him.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,560
What will it take for you to believe me?

3
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:20,640
Lately, have you been losing things you want

4
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:23,400
and things you don't want keep
pestering you?

5
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:26,520
You'll know when the time comes.

6
00:01:28,320 --> 00:01:29,840
-18 degrees?

7
00:01:29,920 --> 00:01:32,720
The Pen Fairy led me to the cold storage?

8
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:41,240
Wong Sai-lung?

9
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:44,000
You again, Mr. Chan?

10
00:01:44,080 --> 00:01:45,760
Sister Fong!

11
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,960
Stay away from me!

12
00:01:49,080 --> 00:01:51,600
Calm down. Don't get the wrong idea.

13
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:54,400
I did not! Sylvia told me

14
00:01:54,480 --> 00:01:55,880
I'll find the uniform in -18 degrees

15
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:57,400
and run into the killer, you!

16
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:58,640
If I killed him,

17
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:00,240
would I be stupid enough to stay
and get caught?

18
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,720
I went inside to see if the killer
was hiding.

19
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,480
Don't try to con me again.

20
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:06,920
You said you needed the uniform for filming.

21
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:10,000
But I saw you in Chin Tai-fu's room
wearing the uniform.

22
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:12,480
If I didn't see the gun and tossed it,

23
00:02:12,560 --> 00:02:13,840
you would have gotten me in big trouble.

24
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,080
You should stick to housekeeping

25
00:02:15,160 --> 00:02:15,960
and leave the gun alone.

26
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:17,240
Luckily, I was vigilant

27
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:20,480
and got away by promising Chin Tai-fu
to kill Wong Sai-lung instead.

28
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:21,840
So you killed Wong Sai-lung!

29
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:23,720
Hello, anyone out there?

30
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:30,160
I told you I didn't do it.

31
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:31,760
What will it take for you to believe me?

32
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:34,800
Definitely not by pointing a gun at me.

33
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:38,480
OK...I'll put it down.

34
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,880
Believe me now?

35
00:02:43,480 --> 00:02:46,120
Yes, I promised to kill Wong Sai-lung,

36
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,200
but when I came in,

37
00:02:47,320 --> 00:02:49,200
someone else already beat me to it.

38
00:02:49,360 --> 00:02:52,000
If you didn't kill him, who did?

39
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,920
When I was approaching the cold storage,

40
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:59,200
I saw someone in housekeeping uniform
walked away.

41
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:01,600
Was he wearing a cap?

42
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:03,120
How did you know?

43
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:05,360
I think I saw him.

44
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:11,280
Was he the killer?

45
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:13,920
Wait...you're also in uniform.

46
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,440
It could have been you.

47
00:03:15,640 --> 00:03:18,320
Look again. Mine had no stains.

48
00:03:18,520 --> 00:03:20,720
Chin Tai-fu took the one I was wearing.

49
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:25,000
Luckily, I found another one in the
changing room.

50
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:27,840
If Chin Tai-fu took yours,

51
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:30,880
and I got the second one from Mrs. Chin,

52
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:34,560
the third one...the killer took it?

53
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:36,880
You finally believe me!

54
00:03:37,040 --> 00:03:38,800
Fullcoin landed me in deep trouble.

55
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:40,720
I have wanted to kill the guy.

56
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:43,600
But someone else killed him

57
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,600
and I must kiss the money goodbye.

58
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:48,280
He's dead and bullets bear no marks.

59
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:51,400
Just tell Chin Tai-fu you got the job done.

60
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,880
You're vicious.

61
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,320
You pay me hush money,

62
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,920
I won't squeal on you.

63
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:59,280
You know why a woman like me
can be so vicious?

64
00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,760
Because I'm also a Fullcoin victim.

65
00:04:01,920 --> 00:04:03,760
My son is still in the hospital.

66
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,560
Chin Tai-fu filed a complaint against me
and I'm about to get canned.

67
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:08,160
You're worse off than I am.

68
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,920
Think no more.

69
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:13,360
It's rare that he died in a cold place.

70
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:14,800
I'll get you some gloves,

71
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:17,920
wrap up the body like cold cut.

72
00:04:21,360 --> 00:04:23,520
This should do the trick.

73
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,200
Thanks, Mr. Chin!

74
00:04:31,520 --> 00:04:32,640
Hey, what's your name.

75
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,400
Yes?

76
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:34,800
You've worked hard all day.

77
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,480
Get your pal in here for a bite.

78
00:04:36,640 --> 00:04:38,520
No thanks, we're not hungry.

79
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:40,800
You need to relax a bit.

80
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:41,920
Go get him.

81
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:47,080
What's up?

82
00:04:47,280 --> 00:04:51,120
Rats! He wants us in there to
help him relax.

83
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:51,960
What?

84
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:55,040
The stud cupcake is not enough?

85
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,840
Now he wants 3P?

86
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:58,320
What now?

87
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:01,280
If anything goes wrong,
I'll punch his lights out.

88
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,480
Great!

89
00:05:03,200 --> 00:05:05,640
Don't just stand there. Eat something.

90
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,120
As professional bodyguards,

91
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:09,280
we must always remain vigilant.

92
00:05:11,720 --> 00:05:13,360
Won't sit down and eat.

93
00:05:13,520 --> 00:05:14,880
Red wine?

94
00:05:15,040 --> 00:05:16,400
As professional bodyguards,

95
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:18,720
we're not supposed to drink.

96
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:20,800
How dutiful of you!

97
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:27,200
I'll drink the wine, you can have tea. OK?

98
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:31,200
Yes, Mr. Chin.

99
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:35,840
Cheers!

100
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:45,040
Thomas! Thomas!

101
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:48,240
Mr. Chin, if you have the need,

102
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:50,400
I'll get the white-haired stud cupcake.

103
00:05:50,520 --> 00:05:51,840
I sell my professionalism,

104
00:05:51,960 --> 00:05:53,600
let's not overdo this.

105
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,200
Here!

106
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,280
He took his clothes off.

107
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:01,120
Mr. Chin must be a cross-dresser.

108
00:06:06,400 --> 00:06:08,080
Mr. Chin, what are you doing?

109
00:06:08,160 --> 00:06:10,400
You said not to overdo it.

110
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:12,320
Let's get started.

111
00:06:12,480 --> 00:06:15,680
I meant to say call it a day. Not overdo it.

112
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:18,720
Be quiet, I'll be gentle. Come on...

113
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,800
You're crazy! I quit!

114
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:23,840
Hey...

115
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:26,800
Remember what I told you?

116
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:29,680
Yes, after I collect the money,

117
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:32,200
find a place to hide the gun.

118
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:34,720
But why must I do that?

119
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:38,720
Wong Sai-lung's body will be
discovered sooner or later.

120
00:06:38,880 --> 00:06:43,400
The cops will look into his connections
with Chin Tai-fu.

121
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:47,760
If we plant the gun in his room,

122
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,680
let him take the rap for it.

123
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:51,840
You think you can frame him by doing that?

124
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:54,000
Though he has a motive,

125
00:06:54,160 --> 00:06:56,800
he's followed by two bodyguards,

126
00:06:56,920 --> 00:06:59,040
they probably can't prove he did it.

127
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,360
If he paid you for the hit,

128
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:04,560
he could have hired a second hitman.

129
00:07:04,720 --> 00:07:06,000
True.

130
00:07:06,160 --> 00:07:09,680
Chin Tai-fu and Wong Sai-lung
are rich but heartless.

131
00:07:09,800 --> 00:07:12,400
Plenty of people want them dead.

132
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,960
That's why we must act fast.

133
00:07:15,080 --> 00:07:17,400
If the other hitman beat us to him,

134
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:19,640
he'll walk away with the golden egg.

135
00:07:21,640 --> 00:07:23,760
Darn! I forgot my phone.

136
00:07:25,640 --> 00:07:27,600
What? I was right about it!

137
00:07:27,680 --> 00:07:29,840
He stole the third uniform.

138
00:07:31,640 --> 00:07:32,520
Hey...

139
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,720
Chin Tai-fu?

140
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,080
Oh dear, I knocked out the golden egg.

141
00:07:36,200 --> 00:07:36,880
What now?

142
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:38,960
Take him into his room.

143
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:42,200
Hurry...come on!

144
00:07:43,760 --> 00:07:45,280
Get in!

145
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:50,800
Why didn't you look before you hit him?

146
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:53,520
How would I know he wore my uniform?

147
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,720
What happened out there?

148
00:07:56,880 --> 00:08:00,320
Who cares? Put the gun in a safe place.

149
00:08:00,480 --> 00:08:03,040
Before Chin Tai-fu wakes up,
I'm taking the uniform.

150
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:04,560
OK!

151
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:29,120
All set?

152
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:31,360
While Chin Tai-fu is unconscious, wait here.

153
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:34,160
Hey...you think I can do this alone?

154
00:08:34,800 --> 00:08:36,320
You did the job,

155
00:08:36,400 --> 00:08:37,600
you should stay and collect your money.

156
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:39,280
I can't be here.

157
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,680
What are you doing?

158
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:49,600
Mr. Chin called me to clean up.

159
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:11,040
Sorry, Mr. Chin. I fell asleep.

160
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:13,440
You again?

161
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:16,320
Yes, Mr. Chin asked me to clean the room.

162
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:18,000
Can I help you?

163
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:21,440
Carry on with Mr. Chin...

164
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:24,720
I mean carry on with helping Mr. Chin.

165
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:30,880
Hello, Mr. Chin.

166
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:35,280
Bloody hell, you took my clothes off?

167
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,880
And conked me on the head?

168
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,640
No, I'm just reporting back to you.

169
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:40,120
For what?

170
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:42,720
I exceeded my target.

171
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:44,560
Here!

172
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:48,800
Sai-lung, you weasel!

173
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:51,840
You want to kill me? Go to Hell!

174
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:57,680
Wait...did you see who hit me?

175
00:09:57,760 --> 00:10:01,760
I think...one of Brother Kui's boys...

176
00:10:02,600 --> 00:10:04,320
Whoever conked me on the head...

177
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:06,240
you did a good job.

178
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:09,280
I'll transfer the money to you.

179
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:12,080
Mr. Chin, my account has been frozen.

180
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,360
Can you pay cash?

181
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,760
Who would carry $1M in cash?

182
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:17,800
I'll write you a cheque,

183
00:10:17,920 --> 00:10:19,920
you can fill out the name.

184
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:24,840
A few minutes in bed is what I make
in a few years?!

185
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:38,640
I have done nothing wrong since
I got married.

186
00:10:38,760 --> 00:10:40,240
With a misunderstanding like that,

187
00:10:40,400 --> 00:10:41,920
my wife is likely to kill me.

188
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:42,960
Hello, Mr. Chin.

189
00:10:43,040 --> 00:10:44,160
You have been pacing around for a while.

190
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,280
Can I help you?

191
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:46,560
I'm not in anybody's way.

192
00:10:46,640 --> 00:10:48,960
I'm not allowed to pace up and down
the hotel lobby?

193
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,160
That's not what I mean.

194
00:10:50,240 --> 00:10:52,240
Your wife just called room service,

195
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:54,880
and ordered the most expensive wine
in our hotel,

196
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:56,400
and the most expensive dish
on the a la carte menu.

197
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,680
I saw you pacing up and down,

198
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:59,120
I just thought maybe I can be of service.

199
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,080
How much was the bill?

200
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:01,200
$23,000 in total.

201
00:11:01,280 --> 00:11:03,120
Oh my God!

202
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:06,320
Nothing like the wrath of a pissed wife.

203
00:11:06,400 --> 00:11:09,440
I better go up and keep her company.

204
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:10,720
Of course.

205
00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:14,640
Wait...it's not resolved.

206
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:16,720
If she asked me again, what can I tell her?

207
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:18,920
She didn't believe I sold a gun.

208
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:23,440
After all, I'm worried about the money.

209
00:11:23,560 --> 00:11:25,680
If I found money to cover up the losses,

210
00:11:25,760 --> 00:11:27,680
I'll have nothing to worry about.

211
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:32,000
GHB, cross-dresser...

212
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:34,560
Luckily, he just finished with the
white-haired stud cupcake.

213
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:36,800
But who knows when he'll have the urge.

214
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:39,200
I don't know how I can go on with this job.

215
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,480
Hey!
Mr. Chin?

216
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:43,600
Are you awake?

217
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:44,720
Yes.

218
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:47,360
You don't look like you can protect me.

219
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,680
I'll pay you for another month. You may go.

220
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:50,960
Great!

221
00:11:57,880 --> 00:12:00,480
Hi! Is Mr. Chin inside?

222
00:12:00,640 --> 00:12:02,880
I have a business proposal for him.

223
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:04,400
Mr. Chin is waiting for you.

224
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:05,680
Just knock on the door.

225
00:12:05,800 --> 00:12:08,720
He really needs you. Good luck.

226
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:15,120
The clown from next door?

227
00:12:16,120 --> 00:12:16,960
Mr. Chin!

228
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,520
Hey, Mr. Chin...

229
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:49,520
Are you OK, Boss?

230
00:12:51,600 --> 00:12:54,560
You traitor! You took money
from Sai-lung, right?

231
00:12:54,640 --> 00:12:57,040
I hurried back as soon as I got your call.

232
00:12:57,120 --> 00:12:58,800
Then what took you so long?

233
00:12:58,920 --> 00:13:01,600
I went up north to find out who
took the order.

234
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:04,240
Since I had time to spare,
I had a bit of fun on the side.

235
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,920
You went whoring when
your Boss is in danger?

236
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:07,120
Are you out of your mind?

237
00:13:07,200 --> 00:13:09,760
I found out a hitman syndicate
is after you.

238
00:13:19,120 --> 00:13:21,520
(Yip Wing-kei)

239
00:13:22,000 --> 00:13:23,200
Tie him up.

240
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:27,040
Brother Kei? It's Fu.

241
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:30,640
How about we clean the slate?

242
00:13:30,800 --> 00:13:33,600
I'll pay you back the money you lost
in Fullcoin.

243
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:35,760
Just hear me out...

244
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:39,600
The guy you hired to kill me
is now in my room.

245
00:13:39,800 --> 00:13:41,360
Either you take my money,

246
00:13:41,520 --> 00:13:45,600
and guarantee me and family
will live happily ever after,

247
00:13:45,760 --> 00:13:48,320
or else, if anything should happen to me,

248
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:52,160
I guarantee I'll use my entire fortune
to kill you.

249
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:55,600
Good, I'm glad you understand.

250
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:57,200
Bye!

251
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:01,760
Feed him to the dogs.

252
00:14:01,880 --> 00:14:03,440
Got it..

253
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:05,520
Sai-lung is dead.

254
00:14:06,240 --> 00:14:08,880
The Showbiz King is sorted out.

255
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:11,280
Time for a drink.

256
00:14:13,680 --> 00:14:15,200
Bloody hell!

257
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:16,640
I'm sorry, Mr. Chin.

258
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:18,560
It's OK. Come here.

259
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:22,960
You have the guts. You saved my neck.

260
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:25,360
You flatter me. As long as you're OK.

261
00:14:25,560 --> 00:14:28,480
Come here...you have a business proposal?

262
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:29,840
Yes, I have...

263
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:33,360
OK...send the proposal to my secretary.

264
00:14:33,520 --> 00:14:34,800
I'll give you $10M.

265
00:14:36,280 --> 00:14:37,840
Thank you, Mr. Chin...

266
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:40,640
Don't thank me, thank your wife.

267
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:48,480
Natasha knows Mr. Chin?

268
00:14:48,600 --> 00:14:50,320
Thank her for what?

269
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:55,520
Let's try the bed.

270
00:14:57,440 --> 00:14:59,840
It's so comfy.

271
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:08,160
You must have a touching story to tell.

272
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:10,240
Try me.

273
00:15:11,640 --> 00:15:15,360
Believe it or not, I wasn't cheating on you.

274
00:15:15,760 --> 00:15:18,000
What were you doing, sneaking around
in that room?

275
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:19,680
While we were having dinner,

276
00:15:19,800 --> 00:15:21,360
I found a gun on the trolley.

277
00:15:21,520 --> 00:15:22,800
I decided to sell it.

278
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:26,720
So I grabbed the towels and tried the gun
in another room.

279
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:31,600
That's brilliant. You're such a lecher!

280
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,360
How could you come up with a lie like that?

281
00:15:33,520 --> 00:15:35,360
Then how do you explain

282
00:15:35,480 --> 00:15:38,400
why Chin Tai-fu was willing to
invest in my company.

283
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:42,320
When I thanked him, he said
I should thank you.

284
00:15:43,080 --> 00:15:45,280
I pretended to have an affair with him

285
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:47,840
so he could ditch his bodyguards
and leave the room.

286
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:49,200
To thank me for a favor,

287
00:15:49,280 --> 00:15:51,200
he gave me his key card so I can
take pictures of the Ambassador Suite

288
00:15:51,280 --> 00:15:52,800
and show them to my besties.

289
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:54,640
Are you so vain?

290
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:57,520
You cheat on your husband
in order to take pictures?

291
00:15:57,680 --> 00:15:59,920
So you can cheat on me
but I can't take pictures?

292
00:16:00,040 --> 00:16:02,160
I don't mind you cheating on me.

293
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:03,520
As long as I put a stop to it.

294
00:16:03,640 --> 00:16:06,000
What do you mean, Chin Chi-tat?

295
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:08,640
You want a divorce?

296
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:14,240
Chin Chi-tat...

297
00:16:14,800 --> 00:16:16,400
Open the door!

298
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:29,120
Hello, Boss?

299
00:16:29,200 --> 00:16:31,360
Arrange for my wife to come home.

300
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:35,680
Get the bellboy to come up and help me pack.

301
00:16:36,040 --> 00:16:37,360
Yes, I'm leaving.

302
00:16:41,600 --> 00:16:45,120
I can't believe that guy would pay us, yeah!

303
00:16:45,200 --> 00:16:46,240
How much was it?

304
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:47,840
$1M.

305
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,800
$1M?

306
00:16:49,920 --> 00:16:51,600
How do you spell your name?

307
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:53,320
How could you, Silver Fox?

308
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:54,720
Why are you putting my name down?

309
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:56,560
How else can we deposit the cheque?

310
00:16:56,680 --> 00:16:58,920
A hired hit is a big deal.

311
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:01,360
I'm in big trouble when the cops
start to investigate.

312
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:04,160
My account has been frozen.

313
00:17:04,280 --> 00:17:05,320
We give up the money?

314
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:07,840
Ask him for cash, you idiot!

315
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:10,120
Who would walk around with $1M cash?

316
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:13,560
I'll write down Chit Chat Kui's name.

317
00:17:13,680 --> 00:17:14,960
I should cut him a share.

318
00:17:15,120 --> 00:17:16,880
Punks are not to be trusted.

319
00:17:17,040 --> 00:17:18,960
Don't cut him in, he'll get greedy.

320
00:17:19,080 --> 00:17:21,120
Write down my name.

321
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:24,640
When the bank opens tomorrow,

322
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:26,400
we'll deposit the cheque.

323
00:17:28,040 --> 00:17:30,400
I'll keep the cheque, we'll split it 50/50.

324
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,560
It's payable to you,

325
00:17:31,680 --> 00:17:33,640
you won't need to worry about me
running off.

326
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:35,880
Is that what you think of me?

327
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:38,240
My heart has gone off to the $500K.

328
00:17:38,360 --> 00:17:41,080
It's so hard to come to work
after you won the first prize.

329
00:17:41,200 --> 00:17:42,880
There! I finally found you!

330
00:17:43,040 --> 00:17:45,280
That witch can't fire me anymore.

331
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:47,040
Where's the uniform?

332
00:17:48,880 --> 00:17:50,480
What is this?

333
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:53,280
You again, Mr. Chan?

334
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:56,640
Silver Fox left you in Chin Tai-fu's room.

335
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:59,760
Hell! Someone will find you eventually.

336
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:13,440
How did the gun end up in the
laundry cart?

337
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:16,040
Someone must have touched this gun.

338
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:18,520
What happened in the hotel?

339
00:18:18,640 --> 00:18:22,240
I know so much, the cops will catch on.

340
00:18:22,360 --> 00:18:23,880
I better run.

341
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:27,840
You're not firing me, I quit.

342
00:18:27,960 --> 00:18:29,760
I have money now.

343
00:18:29,880 --> 00:18:31,600
Two down, one to go.

344
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:33,800
You can't accuse me of theft.

345
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:35,760
You're always on my case.

346
00:18:35,880 --> 00:18:38,960
Bloody Yu Lo, I can't stand you. I quit.

347
00:18:39,080 --> 00:18:41,280
I will tell management you framed me.

348
00:18:42,480 --> 00:18:44,320
Bloody witch!

349
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:57,040
Honey...I'm sorry.

350
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:59,440
You're the only one I love.

351
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:04,040
I intend to die with you!

352
00:19:15,520 --> 00:19:17,840
Chan Lai-sa, what were you thinking?

353
00:19:17,920 --> 00:19:21,080
You had an affair with a rich man
and wanted to ditch me.

354
00:19:28,240 --> 00:19:31,560
Hell, you took the toothpaste
so I can't even brush my teeth!

355
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,160
Brother Bo!

356
00:19:32,240 --> 00:19:32,760
What?

357
00:19:32,840 --> 00:19:34,520
We have a new case.

358
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:36,880
Billionaire Chin Tai-fu was found dead
in a hotel room.

359
00:19:36,960 --> 00:19:38,480
After his body was sent to the hospital,

360
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:39,680
they found something suspicious
about his death.

361
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:40,960
That's why they passed the case to us
to follow up.

362
00:19:41,080 --> 00:19:41,880
Yes, Sir!

363
00:19:42,040 --> 00:19:44,640
The estimated time of death

364
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:48,280
was between 11 p.m. and 1 a.m.

365
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:51,200
The cause of death was the explosion
of the pacemaker

366
00:19:51,360 --> 00:19:52,800
blew up his lungs.

367
00:19:52,920 --> 00:19:56,160
Except for a flat wound of 1.5cm in diameter
on his inner thigh,

368
00:19:56,320 --> 00:19:57,920
there were no other wounds on is body.

369
00:19:58,080 --> 00:19:59,680
That's a rare way to die.

370
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:02,480
Why would the pacemaker explode?

371
00:20:02,560 --> 00:20:04,720
The first person to find Chin Tai-fu's
body was his chauffeur...

372
00:20:04,800 --> 00:20:05,320
Mr. Chin...

373
00:20:05,440 --> 00:20:08,640
The last time he spoke to Chin Tai-fu
was last night at 11:55 p.m.

374
00:20:08,760 --> 00:20:10,280
Mr. Chin!

375
00:20:13,240 --> 00:20:14,720
Boss!

376
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:19,360
My Boss is dead!

377
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:20,240
What?

378
00:20:21,200 --> 00:20:24,160
The doors were locked. What happened?

379
00:20:26,760 --> 00:20:30,720
Ms. Yu, what's the occupancy on this floor?

380
00:20:30,800 --> 00:20:33,320
This is the top floor of our hotel.

381
00:20:33,440 --> 00:20:37,600
We only have two suites on this floor.

382
00:20:37,720 --> 00:20:39,120
According to our record,

383
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:41,800
a couple checked into the Executive Suite
next door.

384
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:44,080
They checked out three hours ago.

385
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:45,560
We got something.

386
00:20:50,320 --> 00:20:51,920
That looks like a stun gun.

387
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:54,520
Did the killer use a stun gun
on Chin Tai-fu,

388
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:56,400
and the pacemaker exploded?

389
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:57,680
Then he ditched the stun gun.

390
00:20:57,800 --> 00:21:01,760
Maybe the killer gave Chin Tai-fu a shot
to knock him out.

391
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:05,520
Then used the stun gun to blow up
the pacemaker.

392
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:08,520
The wound on the inner thigh was flat.

393
00:21:08,640 --> 00:21:10,280
That didn't look like a wound from a needle.

394
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:14,320
The power of the stun gun is not enough
to blow up the pacemaker.

395
00:21:14,720 --> 00:21:17,520
Brother Bo, Chin Tai-fu's chauffeur
Roy is here.

396
00:21:17,640 --> 00:21:19,680
How can I help you, officers?

397
00:21:19,800 --> 00:21:21,360
Before Chin Tai-fu died,

398
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:23,640
did you notice anything unusual?

399
00:21:23,800 --> 00:21:25,440
Not too long before the Boss died,

400
00:21:25,560 --> 00:21:28,280
a white-haired man barged inside
and tried to kill him.

401
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:30,800
Luckily, I came back just in time
to protect the Boss.

402
00:21:30,920 --> 00:21:33,840
What happened to the white-haired man?

403
00:21:34,280 --> 00:21:35,680
He got away.

404
00:21:36,680 --> 00:21:39,120
The case found under the sofa

405
00:21:39,280 --> 00:21:42,400
was probably brought in by
the white-haired man?

406
00:21:43,360 --> 00:21:45,440
After the man got away,

407
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:49,120
did Chin Tai-fu have any unusual behavior?

408
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:52,400
After the killer left,
he probably felt there was no more threat.

409
00:21:52,480 --> 00:21:54,080
He wanted to go home.

410
00:21:54,200 --> 00:21:56,640
He asked me to get help with his luggage.

411
00:21:56,760 --> 00:21:59,920
I can't believe he died
while I stepped away.

412
00:22:00,440 --> 00:22:04,800
A white-haired man
barged in here to commit murder.

413
00:22:04,920 --> 00:22:06,280
He even brought a weapon.

414
00:22:06,400 --> 00:22:08,400
He's probably a professional hitman.

415
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:11,960
I suspect Wong Sai-lung hired the hit.

416
00:22:22,080 --> 00:22:25,680
I suspect Wong Sai-lung hired the hit.

417
00:22:25,840 --> 00:22:28,160
If Wong Sai-lung hired the hit,

418
00:22:28,240 --> 00:22:29,480
after the hitman failed,

419
00:22:29,560 --> 00:22:32,480
did he come back for a second attempt?

420
00:22:32,560 --> 00:22:37,360
Or did Wong Sai-lung decide to kill
Chin Tai-fun himself?

421
00:22:45,240 --> 00:22:49,040
Brother Bo, we suspect Wong Sai-lung
hired the hit on Chin Tai-fu.

422
00:22:49,160 --> 00:22:50,960
But now that he's dead,

423
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:52,600
we have no more leads.

424
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:54,480
Wong Sai-lung may be dead,

425
00:22:54,560 --> 00:22:57,120
it doesn't mean our deduction is wrong.

426
00:22:57,240 --> 00:22:59,200
He was shot.

427
00:22:59,600 --> 00:23:02,880
Was the killer the white-haired man?

428
00:23:03,400 --> 00:23:06,400
If the killer had a gun,

429
00:23:06,520 --> 00:23:09,760
why didn't he just shoot Chin Tai-fu?

430
00:23:09,880 --> 00:23:12,400
Was there more than one killer?

431
00:23:12,760 --> 00:23:14,960
What? Another body?

432
00:23:15,080 --> 00:23:19,120
F&amp;B found the body, when they
went to the cold storage for frozen meat.

433
00:23:20,120 --> 00:23:21,200
We're finished.

434
00:23:21,280 --> 00:23:23,320
Hotel de Maze became Hotel Double Homicide.

435
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:26,040
Did you spot anyone suspicious
these last two days?

436
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:29,840
Yes! Law Siu-fong from housekeeping.

437
00:23:29,960 --> 00:23:31,120
She has a poor record

438
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:32,320
and was caught stealing from the hotel.

439
00:23:32,400 --> 00:23:33,960
Yesterday, she was acting weird,

440
00:23:34,040 --> 00:23:35,680
she begged me not to fire her,

441
00:23:35,760 --> 00:23:37,760
but at the end of her shift,

442
00:23:37,840 --> 00:23:40,160
she tendered her resignation.

443
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:41,360
That's her.

444
00:23:42,440 --> 00:23:45,320
Brother Bo, we got something on CCTV.

445
00:23:58,840 --> 00:24:00,080
This white-haired guy

446
00:24:00,200 --> 00:24:03,280
is probably the hitman mentioned by
Chin Tai-fu's chauffeur.

447
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:05,800
Who is this white-haired killer?

448
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:08,720
Why did he want to kill Chin Tai-fu

449
00:24:08,880 --> 00:24:11,920
but turned around and killed Wong Sai-lung?

450
00:24:16,520 --> 00:24:18,480
Wu Sir, go check out

451
00:24:18,560 --> 00:24:21,320
anyone who had close contact with
Wong Sai-lung and Chin Tai-fu,

452
00:24:21,400 --> 00:24:22,800
find out about their relationship.

453
00:24:22,880 --> 00:24:25,520
Ming, question the hotel staff,

454
00:24:25,600 --> 00:24:27,720
especially F&amp;B and housekeeping.

455
00:24:27,800 --> 00:24:31,560
See if they have seen the white-haired guy
within hotel premises.

456
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:32,520
Got it, Brother Bo.

457
00:24:32,640 --> 00:24:35,520
King, check the CCTVs near the hotel.

458
00:24:35,640 --> 00:24:39,600
See if any of them recorded the
white-haired guy and Law Siu-fong.

459
00:24:39,720 --> 00:24:40,640
Got it!

460
00:24:40,760 --> 00:24:46,200
1...2...3...4...5...6...
other than fake money,

461
00:24:46,280 --> 00:24:48,960
I have never seen so many digits
on a cheque.

462
00:24:53,600 --> 00:24:55,280
Hello, Ms. Yu?

463
00:24:55,360 --> 00:24:58,880
I saw Sister Fong with a white-haired man
queuing up in the bank.

464
00:24:59,040 --> 00:25:00,400
Once we deposit this cheque,

465
00:25:00,520 --> 00:25:02,280
my life will be completely changed.

466
00:25:02,360 --> 00:25:04,640
What? It's Chin Tai-fu!

467
00:25:04,760 --> 00:25:06,040
Chin Tai-fu is here?

468
00:25:06,480 --> 00:25:07,720
Where is Chin Tai-fu?

469
00:25:07,800 --> 00:25:08,840
He's dead.

470
00:25:08,920 --> 00:25:09,840
Chin Tai-fu is dead?

471
00:25:09,920 --> 00:25:10,640
Yes!

472
00:25:11,960 --> 00:25:13,960
(Chin Tai-fu found dead in hotel)

473
00:25:14,320 --> 00:25:16,840
If he's dead, what about our cheque?

474
00:25:18,040 --> 00:25:19,680
We better not touch the money.

475
00:25:19,760 --> 00:25:22,000
No? We're next.

476
00:25:22,120 --> 00:25:24,200
Chin Tai-fu died in the hotel.

477
00:25:24,280 --> 00:25:25,560
We're in trouble if we touch the money.

478
00:25:25,640 --> 00:25:26,640
Let's go!
No...

479
00:25:26,720 --> 00:25:30,520
What? Wong Sai-lung who was in charge
of Fullcoin is dead too?

480
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:34,040
They found Wong Sai-lung's body. Let's go.

481
00:25:34,440 --> 00:25:35,600
This is killing me.

482
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:38,000
The money is almost ours.

483
00:25:38,080 --> 00:25:40,880
If we took it, we would have been busted.

484
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:42,560
They'll pin the murders on us

485
00:25:42,640 --> 00:25:43,960
and we'll never clear our names.

486
00:25:44,040 --> 00:25:45,440
Why are we involved?

487
00:25:45,520 --> 00:25:47,200
Why are we involved?

488
00:25:47,600 --> 00:25:50,600
This cheque is the evidence.

489
00:25:50,720 --> 00:25:53,440
It's not safe to keep it, let's toss it.

490
00:25:53,600 --> 00:25:56,160
No! Maybe in six months,

491
00:25:56,320 --> 00:25:57,760
when things have died down, we can cash it.

492
00:25:57,880 --> 00:25:59,320
Don't be so naive.

493
00:25:59,440 --> 00:26:00,760
You think the cops are stupid?

494
00:26:00,840 --> 00:26:02,040
Not until they catch the killer,

495
00:26:02,120 --> 00:26:03,640
we'll never be off the hook.

496
00:26:03,760 --> 00:26:05,440
Let's just rip the cheque.

497
00:26:05,520 --> 00:26:06,600
Don't kill it.

498
00:26:06,680 --> 00:26:08,680
We're in deep trouble if we don't.

499
00:26:09,240 --> 00:26:10,320
Kill what?

500
00:26:10,400 --> 00:26:12,880
This...see? Don't call the Police.

501
00:26:12,960 --> 00:26:16,480
We're tearing up the cheque. Gone!

502
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:27,560
We can always make more money.

503
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:29,560
Don't look so sad.

504
00:26:31,080 --> 00:26:32,960
Those men are staring at us.

505
00:26:33,120 --> 00:26:34,120
They should be cops.

506
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:35,920
Run...

507
00:26:36,080 --> 00:26:37,680
I'll lure them away.
What?

508
00:26:37,800 --> 00:26:40,400
Your son is in the hospital. He needs you.

509
00:26:40,520 --> 00:26:41,560
You can't get busted.

510
00:26:41,640 --> 00:26:42,960
What about you? If you were caught,

511
00:26:43,040 --> 00:26:44,040
what about you wife and child?

512
00:26:44,120 --> 00:26:45,640
They don't need me. Go!

513
00:26:45,720 --> 00:26:46,560
Right!

514
00:26:49,240 --> 00:26:51,120
Silver Fox, stop!

515
00:26:53,200 --> 00:26:57,120
Cheung Tin-fai, did you sneak into
Chin Tai-fu's room and killed him?

516
00:26:57,240 --> 00:26:59,840
I went inside and made a deal with him.

517
00:26:59,960 --> 00:27:02,160
Shall I spill the beans to prove
my innocence?

518
00:27:02,320 --> 00:27:03,760
You took $500K.

519
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:05,920
I'll double that and pay you $1M.

520
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:06,800
Take care of it for me.

521
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:09,040
I have long wanted to kill Wong Sai-lung.

522
00:27:09,600 --> 00:27:11,120
You're on!

523
00:27:11,280 --> 00:27:12,960
We checked all the CCTV,

524
00:27:13,080 --> 00:27:14,400
we have enough evidence.

525
00:27:14,520 --> 00:27:17,120
Once we arrest the chambermaid,

526
00:27:17,280 --> 00:27:19,440
you can get ready to go to jail.

527
00:27:19,600 --> 00:27:21,040
They suspect Sister Fong.

528
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:23,080
But she had nothing to do with this.

529
00:27:23,200 --> 00:27:24,520
I better not spill the beans on her.

530
00:27:24,680 --> 00:27:26,000
OK, I'll tell you.

531
00:27:26,600 --> 00:27:30,400
At first, I took the order to kill
Chin Tai-fu.

532
00:27:30,480 --> 00:27:33,440
I disguised as a housekeeper
to get inside the room.

533
00:27:33,560 --> 00:27:35,680
Where did you get the uniform?

534
00:27:35,800 --> 00:27:37,120
I stole it.

535
00:27:37,680 --> 00:27:40,120
You acted alone? No accomplice?

536
00:27:40,280 --> 00:27:44,240
Yes, but before I got into his room,

537
00:27:44,400 --> 00:27:45,920
I lost the gun.

538
00:27:46,080 --> 00:27:48,040
You said you didn't kill Chin Tai-fu
the first time.

539
00:27:48,160 --> 00:27:50,520
Did you go back in a few hours
to make a second attempt?

540
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:54,120
Chin Tai-fu offered me double
the money to kill Wong Sai-lung,

541
00:27:54,240 --> 00:27:55,520
why would I kill him?

542
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:58,000
Wong Sai-lung asked me to meet him
at the cold storage,

543
00:27:58,160 --> 00:27:59,600
to give me the gun.

544
00:27:59,760 --> 00:28:01,800
I decided to kill him right then and there.

545
00:28:01,920 --> 00:28:03,120
But I was too late.

546
00:28:03,240 --> 00:28:05,920
He was shot twice when I arrived.

547
00:28:06,040 --> 00:28:09,800
Twice? Wong Sai-lung was shot three times.

548
00:28:09,920 --> 00:28:12,280
When I picked up the gun, I was scared.

549
00:28:12,360 --> 00:28:14,000
I dropped it and it went off

550
00:28:14,120 --> 00:28:16,360
and shot Wong Sai-lung's body.

551
00:28:16,480 --> 00:28:18,120
You're a professional hitman,

552
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:20,320
how could you be so scared to drop the gun?

553
00:28:20,440 --> 00:28:23,920
I didn't know someone shot him twice
in the head.

554
00:28:24,040 --> 00:28:27,120
We saw from the CCTV you were following
Wong Sai-lung,

555
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:28,400
then you went inside the cold storage.

556
00:28:28,480 --> 00:28:29,640
How do you explain that?

557
00:28:29,720 --> 00:28:31,320
That wasn't me.

558
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:34,640
Can't tell the body shape from a top shot.

559
00:28:34,800 --> 00:28:36,320
Yes, the Boss is dead.

560
00:28:36,400 --> 00:28:38,160
I just finished giving a statement.

561
00:28:39,120 --> 00:28:39,920
Excuse me...

562
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:41,080
What is it, Sir?

563
00:28:41,880 --> 00:28:43,360
We caught the white-haired hitman,

564
00:28:43,440 --> 00:28:44,320
can you identify him for us?

565
00:28:44,360 --> 00:28:45,880
What? You caught him?

566
00:28:47,880 --> 00:28:49,840
Sir, it's not him.

567
00:28:49,960 --> 00:28:51,680
They can't pin it on me.

568
00:28:51,840 --> 00:28:53,360
Shouldn't have told them so much.

569
00:28:53,520 --> 00:28:54,800
Thank you.

570
00:28:57,000 --> 00:29:00,160
See? I told you I didn't follow
Wong Sai-lung.

571
00:29:00,320 --> 00:29:02,520
I didn't kill Chin Tai-fu either.

572
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:07,440
What is Brother Bo doing?

573
00:29:07,600 --> 00:29:09,760
He's been lying there for ages.

574
00:29:11,760 --> 00:29:15,320
The autopsy report said something
entered Chin Tai-fu's body

575
00:29:15,400 --> 00:29:18,880
that caused his pacemaker to explode.

576
00:29:19,040 --> 00:29:21,080
I have looked everywhere in this room

577
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:23,760
and didn't find anything connected.

578
00:29:26,600 --> 00:29:28,880
Ming, lie down.

579
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:29,720
Me?

580
00:29:29,800 --> 00:29:31,680
Lie down, spreadeagled like I did just now.

581
00:29:31,760 --> 00:29:33,400
Hurry, spread your legs.

582
00:29:33,520 --> 00:29:35,160
You, come here and poke him.

583
00:29:35,280 --> 00:29:36,560
Use your finger.

584
00:29:36,640 --> 00:29:37,640
That's rather x-rated.

585
00:29:37,720 --> 00:29:39,200
Just do it.

586
00:29:39,680 --> 00:29:41,440
Show me the direction.

587
00:29:42,040 --> 00:29:47,680
The wound...the heart...in that direction.

588
00:29:52,840 --> 00:29:57,080
How could Natasha get mixed up
with Chin Tai-fu?

589
00:29:58,080 --> 00:29:59,760
How could he mess with a married woman?

590
00:29:59,840 --> 00:30:01,000
Go to Hell, you jerk!

591
00:30:01,080 --> 00:30:02,400
We bring you the breaking news...

592
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:05,560
Billionaire Chin Tai-fu was found dead
in Hotel de Maze this morning.

593
00:30:05,680 --> 00:30:08,760
The Police has indicated his cause of death
has yet to be confirmed.

594
00:30:08,840 --> 00:30:11,040
We just received another breaking news.

595
00:30:11,160 --> 00:30:14,160
Businessman Wong Sai-lung was also
found dead inside Hotel de Maze.

596
00:30:14,240 --> 00:30:15,320
He was shot in the head.

597
00:30:15,400 --> 00:30:17,920
It is unknown at the moment whether
their deaths are related.

598
00:30:18,560 --> 00:30:21,520
Wong Sai-lung was the man in charge of
Fullcoin, the recent talk of the town.

599
00:30:21,640 --> 00:30:23,200
Now that he was shot to death,

600
00:30:23,360 --> 00:30:26,640
it's unknown whether his death
is related to the recent Fullcoin incident.

601
00:30:27,040 --> 00:30:29,680
Honey, Wong Sai-lung is dead!
Honey, Wong Sai-lung is dead!

602
00:30:30,160 --> 00:30:32,040
Crap, I'm definitely involved.

603
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:33,680
Why are you involved?

604
00:30:33,800 --> 00:30:36,360
I told you I found a gun,

605
00:30:36,480 --> 00:30:38,320
and I sold it to someone.

606
00:30:38,440 --> 00:30:41,280
I know. I believe you now.

607
00:30:41,440 --> 00:30:44,560
But it's my problem, not yours.

608
00:30:45,360 --> 00:30:48,320
No, Honey. It's not.

609
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:51,080
Brother Bo, do you think it looks ruined?

610
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:54,080
Mosaic feature walls are like that.

611
00:31:02,600 --> 00:31:03,600
Laser pen.

612
00:31:10,480 --> 00:31:12,440
Remember that day we had a fight?

613
00:31:12,520 --> 00:31:15,200
You went inside a room and I was pissed?

614
00:31:15,280 --> 00:31:16,960
I wanted to drink iced water.

615
00:31:17,040 --> 00:31:19,560
Guess what I saw in the ice bucket?

616
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:21,440
I found a gun.

617
00:31:23,240 --> 00:31:25,840
When the bullet was shot into the wall,
it created friction

618
00:31:25,920 --> 00:31:28,000
that shattered the bullet.

619
00:31:28,120 --> 00:31:31,440
One of the bullet fragments
shot the inner thigh

620
00:31:31,600 --> 00:31:33,920
and caused his pacemaker to explode.

621
00:31:34,040 --> 00:31:35,320
That's the cause of death.

622
00:31:35,440 --> 00:31:37,360
Bravo!

623
00:31:38,360 --> 00:31:40,880
Why didn't you tell me about it?

624
00:31:41,000 --> 00:31:42,160
What happened to the gun?

625
00:31:42,320 --> 00:31:44,640
I was really scared.

626
00:31:44,800 --> 00:31:47,360
I ditched it right away.

627
00:31:48,840 --> 00:31:52,360
Then I filled up the hole with toothpaste.

628
00:31:52,440 --> 00:31:54,880
No wonder there was no toothpaste
in my room.

629
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:57,560
Look, we didn't kill anyone.

630
00:31:57,680 --> 00:31:59,560
Let's go to the Police station

631
00:31:59,680 --> 00:32:01,840
and tell the Police what happened.

632
00:32:01,960 --> 00:32:04,760
Ming, ask Ms. Yu for the guest information
of this room.

633
00:32:04,920 --> 00:32:06,600
We need to question them.

634
00:32:06,680 --> 00:32:07,480
Got it.

635
00:32:07,560 --> 00:32:10,160
Brother Bo, King said the couple from
the Executive Suite

636
00:32:10,240 --> 00:32:12,080
went to the Police Station.

637
00:32:12,600 --> 00:32:14,400
Honey!
Honey!

638
00:32:14,920 --> 00:32:16,800
I'm glad you're here.
I'm sorry, it's my fault.

639
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:18,720
I should care more about you.
I shouldn't hold out on you...

640
00:32:18,800 --> 00:32:20,160
Let me finish...
I didn't mean to...

641
00:32:20,240 --> 00:32:21,560
Listen to me!

642
00:32:21,640 --> 00:32:23,200
I shouldn't be mad at you.

643
00:32:23,280 --> 00:32:25,680
Then none of this would have happened.

644
00:32:25,840 --> 00:32:27,920
No...it was my fault.

645
00:32:28,040 --> 00:32:30,600
Please go to the Crime Unit
to give your statement.

646
00:32:30,960 --> 00:32:33,880
Don't worry, we'll be OK after
we give our statement.

647
00:32:44,720 --> 00:32:48,240
I tried the gun in a room

648
00:32:48,560 --> 00:32:50,160
and then sold it.

649
00:32:54,000 --> 00:32:55,320
Here...

650
00:32:57,760 --> 00:33:01,040
I didn't know there was a gun in the
ice bucket.

651
00:33:01,160 --> 00:33:03,800
My hand was shaking when I picked it up.

652
00:33:03,920 --> 00:33:05,320
I accidentally dropped it on the floor

653
00:33:05,440 --> 00:33:07,200
and the gun went off.

654
00:33:07,320 --> 00:33:09,880
I was really scared.

655
00:33:10,000 --> 00:33:12,560
I was fighting with my husband at the time

656
00:33:12,680 --> 00:33:16,560
and I remembered he said he found
a gun in the hotel

657
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:18,120
and he sold it later.

658
00:33:18,240 --> 00:33:20,760
I was afraid someone would find the gun

659
00:33:20,880 --> 00:33:22,840
and my husband would get into trouble.

660
00:33:22,960 --> 00:33:25,520
So I took it outside to ditch it.

661
00:33:25,600 --> 00:33:29,120
I remember seeing a laundry cart
in the backstairs of the 10/F.

662
00:33:29,240 --> 00:33:31,440
I decided to leave it in there.

663
00:33:31,600 --> 00:33:33,440
But the cart was gone.

664
00:33:33,560 --> 00:33:35,440
Then I went downstairs to the ground floor,

665
00:33:35,560 --> 00:33:38,560
and put the gun in a laundry bag
inside the cart.

666
00:33:45,480 --> 00:33:47,920
Did Chan Lai-sa make this up?

667
00:33:48,840 --> 00:33:50,000
According to her statement,

668
00:33:50,120 --> 00:33:51,320
even if we don't find the gun,

669
00:33:51,440 --> 00:33:52,640
we don't have enough to nail her.

670
00:33:52,760 --> 00:33:54,880
We're almost certain

671
00:33:55,000 --> 00:33:58,480
Chin Tai-fu was shot because the gun
went off

672
00:33:58,600 --> 00:34:00,160
when Chan Lai-sa dropped it.

673
00:34:00,280 --> 00:34:03,120
The question is where is the gun now

674
00:34:03,240 --> 00:34:04,760
and how many shots are left.

675
00:34:04,880 --> 00:34:06,800
Cheung Tin-fai mentioned

676
00:34:06,920 --> 00:34:09,640
Wong Sai-lung was shot twice in the head.

677
00:34:09,720 --> 00:34:11,720
Then he got too scared and dropped the gun.

678
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:13,920
It went off and shot Wong Sai-lung again.

679
00:34:14,040 --> 00:34:16,000
Three shots were fired already.

680
00:34:16,120 --> 00:34:20,080
Chin Chi-tat said he fired once
to test the gun.

681
00:34:20,200 --> 00:34:22,480
Plus the shot fired when Chan Lai-sa
dropped the gun,

682
00:34:22,560 --> 00:34:23,640
five shots have been fired.

683
00:34:23,720 --> 00:34:25,320
There should be one bullet left.

684
00:34:25,400 --> 00:34:26,960
Not until we locate the gun,

685
00:34:27,040 --> 00:34:27,920
we're still not safe yet.

686
00:34:28,000 --> 00:34:31,720
If Cheung Tin-fai is not the
white-haired hitman,

687
00:34:31,840 --> 00:34:33,600
who's the real killer?

688
00:34:33,720 --> 00:34:35,280
Where is he hiding?

689
00:34:35,720 --> 00:34:37,920
Would Silver Fox squeal on me?

690
00:34:38,080 --> 00:34:40,320
That's crazy! If he would,

691
00:34:40,440 --> 00:34:42,680
he wouldn't let me go.

692
00:34:44,640 --> 00:34:47,720
I haven't done anything.

693
00:34:47,840 --> 00:34:50,960
I only sold him a few uniforms.

694
00:34:51,080 --> 00:34:54,240
And...I didn't tell anyone I saw a gun.

695
00:34:54,360 --> 00:34:58,400
And...I didn't report Wong Sai-lung's body.

696
00:34:58,560 --> 00:35:00,960
And...I conked Chin Tai-fu on the head.

697
00:35:01,040 --> 00:35:03,040
And...I took his cheque.

698
00:35:04,440 --> 00:35:07,440
I'm dead just from knowing about everything.

699
00:35:08,240 --> 00:35:10,400
Was Fai right about this?

700
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:13,760
Not until the cops catch the real killer,
we're not off the hook?

701
00:35:13,960 --> 00:35:16,280
I only know the hitman was wearing
the housekeeping uniform.

702
00:35:16,360 --> 00:35:18,320
I didn't even see his face.
How can I find him?

703
00:35:18,440 --> 00:35:19,680
Let's just rip the cheque.

704
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:21,320
Don't...

705
00:35:24,360 --> 00:35:26,400
A white-haired dude in uniform?

706
00:35:26,480 --> 00:35:28,480
That's too much of a coincidence.

707
00:35:28,600 --> 00:35:30,760
Silver Fox, stop!

708
00:35:30,880 --> 00:35:32,960
Maybe Wong Sai-lung's killer

709
00:35:33,120 --> 00:35:34,880
was that other Silver Fox.

710
00:35:35,000 --> 00:35:37,440
Why did he get into Yu Lo's car?

711
00:35:37,560 --> 00:35:39,520
He colluded with Yu Lo?

712
00:35:39,680 --> 00:35:42,000
That's why Yu Lo was on my case?

713
00:35:43,920 --> 00:35:47,040
No! What if it wasn't him?

714
00:35:47,200 --> 00:35:49,520
If I call the cops, they will arrest me.

715
00:35:49,680 --> 00:35:51,280
Better not!

716
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:54,320
I'll go to Yu Lo's place and find out
what's going on.

717
00:35:54,480 --> 00:35:56,960
If they're in on this, I'll call the cops.

718
00:36:15,560 --> 00:36:18,240
What happened? Why are you tied up?

719
00:36:19,560 --> 00:36:21,080
I was going out to lunch.

720
00:36:21,160 --> 00:36:22,880
The white-haired dude took me hostage

721
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:24,400
and made me drive him here

722
00:36:24,520 --> 00:36:26,400
or else he would kill me.

723
00:36:26,520 --> 00:36:28,080
Where is he now?

724
00:36:29,360 --> 00:36:31,600
Trying to save your colleague?

725
00:36:32,600 --> 00:36:34,560
Not you again, Mr. Chan!

726
00:36:34,720 --> 00:36:35,560
What are you talking about?

727
00:36:35,640 --> 00:36:37,840
I mean why do you have the gun again?

728
00:36:39,720 --> 00:36:41,760
I was beaten half to death
and thrown in the garbage bin.

729
00:36:42,160 --> 00:36:43,520
I thought I was going to die.

730
00:36:43,600 --> 00:36:48,000
But I lucked out and came across a gun.

731
00:36:48,160 --> 00:36:50,960
I shouldn't have thrown it in the garbage.

732
00:36:51,120 --> 00:36:53,040
You're now my hostage.

733
00:36:53,200 --> 00:36:55,680
If you step outside the house,

734
00:36:55,760 --> 00:36:57,240
I'll blow her head off.

735
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:58,520
No...

736
00:36:58,600 --> 00:36:59,720
Be my guest. I'm leaving.

737
00:36:59,800 --> 00:37:00,600
Stay where you are!

738
00:37:00,680 --> 00:37:03,080
Law Siu-fong, don't go. I'm your Boss.

739
00:37:03,160 --> 00:37:05,720
Shut up, Yu Lo. I already quit.

740
00:37:05,800 --> 00:37:07,760
I'm in this mess thanks to you.

741
00:37:07,840 --> 00:37:10,800
Now the Police suspect me
of killing Wong Sai-lung.

742
00:37:11,080 --> 00:37:12,880
You plan to finger me? Go to Hell!

743
00:37:15,560 --> 00:37:16,560
It's empty?

744
00:37:16,640 --> 00:37:18,760
Luck is on my side.

745
00:37:42,560 --> 00:37:44,160
Luck is on my side.

746
00:37:47,880 --> 00:37:49,200
It doesn't hurt!

747
00:37:50,360 --> 00:37:52,080
No blood?

748
00:37:54,440 --> 00:37:55,280
Cuff him!

749
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:59,080
Thank goodness! Yeah!

750
00:38:00,120 --> 00:38:01,640
Yes, we can live...
Yes, we're alive!

751
00:38:01,720 --> 00:38:03,640
I thought we were going to die!

752
00:38:03,760 --> 00:38:05,200
I was so scared!

753
00:38:05,320 --> 00:38:07,240
Scared me to death...
I'm so scared...

754
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:10,480
Who's your friend now?
Exactly!

755
00:38:12,960 --> 00:38:16,400
Thanks for your hard work in cracking
this bizarre case.

756
00:38:16,520 --> 00:38:18,640
We didn't realize the gun has been fired

757
00:38:18,720 --> 00:38:20,160
so many times by so many people.

758
00:38:20,240 --> 00:38:22,320
And Law Siu-fong really had nine lives.

759
00:38:22,440 --> 00:38:23,920
Brother Bo, don't be so modest.

760
00:38:24,040 --> 00:38:25,920
You saved Law Siu-fong's life.

761
00:38:26,040 --> 00:38:28,480
You really hit the bullseye.

762
00:38:28,640 --> 00:38:29,920
When he fired the first shot,

763
00:38:30,080 --> 00:38:32,320
the gun was empty.

764
00:38:32,720 --> 00:38:33,840
As for the second shot,

765
00:38:33,920 --> 00:38:35,520
Cheung Tin-fai dropped the bullet

766
00:38:35,600 --> 00:38:37,240
and it went inside the uniform.

767
00:38:37,360 --> 00:38:39,640
The killer grabbed it in the end.

768
00:38:39,760 --> 00:38:42,800
We sent the bullet to Forensics for tests

769
00:38:42,920 --> 00:38:45,440
and found curry sauce on it.

770
00:38:45,600 --> 00:38:46,880
It got stuck in the barrel.

771
00:38:47,080 --> 00:38:49,360
That's why I didn't save Law Siu-fong,

772
00:38:49,480 --> 00:38:51,760
it was the dirty bullet.

773
00:38:52,600 --> 00:38:56,240
I didn't expect so much would happen
by checking into the hotel for a day.

774
00:38:58,600 --> 00:39:02,640
I'm sorry, Honey! I should have trusted you.

775
00:39:02,760 --> 00:39:05,040
You threw the gun away for me

776
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:07,680
why would you cheat on me?

777
00:39:09,200 --> 00:39:11,280
I should bear some of the blame.

778
00:39:11,720 --> 00:39:14,240
I have given you too much pressure.

779
00:39:15,280 --> 00:39:18,800
I always use material things
to measure our love.

780
00:39:18,960 --> 00:39:22,760
I realized now, none of that matter.

781
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:27,600
The key is for us to be safe,

782
00:39:28,880 --> 00:39:30,960
and that we are together.

783
00:39:31,520 --> 00:39:33,240
I'm so glad you're OK.

784
00:39:33,920 --> 00:39:37,640
The Police believed you had no intention
to fire that shot

785
00:39:37,760 --> 00:39:40,560
and didn't realize that bullet
would go through the wall

786
00:39:40,680 --> 00:39:42,680
and shoot Chin Tai-fu.

787
00:39:43,640 --> 00:39:48,240
Honey, you won't get a long sentence
for selling the gun.

788
00:39:48,360 --> 00:39:51,160
We'll start over when you get out.

789
00:40:03,880 --> 00:40:09,600
I must thank you for dropping the bullet
in the curry sauce.

790
00:40:09,720 --> 00:40:12,000
The stain was the reason it got stuck.

791
00:40:12,160 --> 00:40:13,920
You indirectly saved my life.

792
00:40:14,000 --> 00:40:16,000
I must thank you.

793
00:40:16,120 --> 00:40:19,520
I didn't realize this unprofessional hitman
did a good thing.

794
00:40:21,120 --> 00:40:23,280
Will I get a lighter sentence for it?

795
00:40:23,440 --> 00:40:28,480
Fai, attempted murder will get
a life sentence.

796
00:40:28,600 --> 00:40:30,680
Now, you only serve a few years.

797
00:40:30,800 --> 00:40:32,560
The jail sentence is nothing.

798
00:40:32,720 --> 00:40:34,560
After everything I did,

799
00:40:34,720 --> 00:40:37,680
I still don't have money in the bank.

800
00:40:38,520 --> 00:40:40,200
Don't say that.

801
00:40:40,520 --> 00:40:42,080
Because Chin Tai-fu is dead,

802
00:40:42,160 --> 00:40:45,760
someone found out he was
the instigator of Fullcoin.

803
00:40:45,920 --> 00:40:51,120
His estate fund agreed to compensate
all the Fullcoin victims.

804
00:40:51,200 --> 00:40:52,160
Really?
Yeah!

805
00:40:52,240 --> 00:40:54,720
When you get out, you'll have money
to pay off your debts.

806
00:40:55,720 --> 00:40:57,200
Thank God!

807
00:40:58,920 --> 00:41:01,360
Yip Wing-kei, a.k.a. the Showbiz King.

808
00:41:01,440 --> 00:41:05,040
Got into a grudge with Chin Tai-fu
over Fullcoiin.

809
00:41:07,320 --> 00:41:12,160
Mr. Yip, your wife and daughter have
boarded the high-speed rail.

810
00:41:12,280 --> 00:41:14,480
I'm putting you up in a hotel.

811
00:41:16,640 --> 00:41:19,840
Royal Island Hotel? Is it safe?

812
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:23,520
I chose this hotel because of its
tight security and abundant staff.

813
00:41:23,600 --> 00:41:26,200
They can ensure your safety.

814
00:41:26,280 --> 00:41:30,160
Chin Tai-fu's hitmen won't find you.

815
00:41:30,240 --> 00:41:34,560
Bloody hell, the guy is dead
and he's still after me.

816
00:41:34,640 --> 00:41:36,000
Don't worry, Mr. Yip!

817
00:41:36,080 --> 00:41:38,400
I already contacted his wife

818
00:41:38,480 --> 00:41:40,560
to let you off the hook.

819
00:42:03,200 --> 00:42:05,720
Thanks for your advice.

820
00:42:06,880 --> 00:42:10,000
Brother Kei, either you take my money,

821
00:42:10,160 --> 00:42:14,320
and guarantee me and family
will live happily ever after,

822
00:42:14,440 --> 00:42:16,960
or else, if anything should happen to me,

823
00:42:17,040 --> 00:42:20,800
I guarantee I'll use my entire fortune
to kill you.

824
00:42:21,880 --> 00:42:26,320
We can make a lot of money from sucker Kei.

825
00:42:26,840 --> 00:42:29,760
What matters is this can go on forever.

826
00:42:29,840 --> 00:42:32,120
Make sure you count me in.
